**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/*.csproj.user
.git/
documentation/
tests/
# The Dockerfile's `evals` stage runs the eval gate against the image's own source, so the gate's project
# comes back in; the rest of tests/ stays out. A workstation's scratch results.json never enters the
# context - the stage writes its own.
!tests/AgentForge.Evals/
tests/AgentForge.Evals/bin/
tests/AgentForge.Evals/obj/
evals/results.json
**/node_modules/
# Kept after the OpenEMR fork stopped being vendored here: the directory no longer exists in
# a fresh clone, but an older one keeps ~85MB of leftover PHP on disk, and without this line that gets
# uploaded to the daemon on every sidecar build. Costs nothing when the path is absent.
external/
